<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38865" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπῐάλλω</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιᾰλῶ</span>: aor.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίηλα [ῑ</span>]:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>send upon</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑτάροις ἐπὶ</span>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χεῖρας ἴαλλε</span>
			<i>laid</i> hands <i>upon</i> them, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				9.288
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ δὲ Ζεὺς οὖρον ἴαλλεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					15.475
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὗτος γὰρ ἐπίηλεν τάδε
			ἔργα</span> for this man <i>brought</i> these deeds <i>to
				pass</i>, <i><span class="en">
				22.49
			</span></i>; also in Com., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιαλῶ</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ κέντρον</span>) I <i>will lay it
				on</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				1299
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				552
			</span></i> (dub. l.), <i><span class="en">
				Phryn.Com.
				1
			</span></i> (dub. l.).</div>
